OL,3,GNEWSADriver who killed man in grass
OL,4,Acutting row jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who ran down and killed a man
OL,7,Fduring a grass cutting dispute has been
OL,8,Fjailed for nine years.
OL,10,FMark Wigley, 60, hit 45-year-old Liam
OL,11,FGreen in a VW Touareg on Rose Tree
OL,12,FAvenue in Cudworth, near Barnsley, at
OL,13,Fabout 17:00 BST on 3 April.
OL,15,FFollowing a trial at Sheffield Crown
OL,16,FCourt, he was cleared of murder but
OL,17,Fconvicted of manslaughter, while his
OL,18,Fdaughter, Sarah Wigley, 39, and
OL,19,Fbrother-in-law, Neil Shaw, 54, were
OL,20,Fcleared of all charges.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
