OL,3,GNEWSADriver who killed man in grass
OL,4,Acutting row jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a hearing earlier, Judge Graham
OL,7,FReeds KC told Wigley, of Royston Road,
OL,8,FCudworth: "It is a case where you used
OL,9,Fyour car as a weapon and intended to
OL,10,Fhit him and cause some injury."
